@title A placed circuit lands where the pointer was on the drawing
@area Schematic
@sizes 1366x768
# Test report 16: circuits dropped at a fixed top-left spot, not at the cursor. The pointer rests on the drawing, then Ctrl+K and Place; the circuit's top-left lands at that spot.
click_text "New project"
wait 20
move 700 400
wait 5
key ctrl+k
text "motor starter dol"
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
try click_text "Motor starter DOL" Label
wait 10
click_text Place Button #2
wait 20
expect "Placed Motor starter DOL"
expect_scene "-K1"
shot placed-at-pointer
